    h1 Leaky Gut
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/diseases/22724-leaky-gut-syndrome") Cleveland Clinic]:
    blockquote Leaky gut syndrome is a hypothetical condition that’s not currently recognized as a medical diagnosis. It’s based on the concept of increased intestinal permeability, which occurs in some gastrointestinal diseases.
